WEBVTT

NOTE
Text descriptions of what is on screen, for people who cannot see the video.

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Filmed from the boundary at Astley Bridge Cricket Club on a grey afternoon. A green outfield with tall trees behind. Greater Manchester Falcons players in purple shirts are spread around the pitch, with the bowler, batter and umpire at the crease in the middle of the frame and a sight screen behind them.

00:12.000 --> 01:00.000
Play continues. The bowler rolls the audible ball down the pitch, the batter swings and the fielders in purple move to gather it. The umpire in a dark top stands at the bowler's end.

01:00.000 --> 02:00.000
More of the same over from the boundary: deliveries, shots, fielders chasing, players walking back to their positions between balls.

02:00.000 --> 02:54.000
The final overs of the innings continue in the same wide view until the recording ends.
